DI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-07-09T14:49:54Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T16:11:11Z","closed_at":"2025-07-18T16:09:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible on v4.4.1.stable.mono.official [49a5bc7b6] (Mac Os/Windows)\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nMac OS Sequoia 15.5 - Windows 10 - Windows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nAs title says a missing filesystem_cache10 from .godot/editor triggers reimport for *all* assets.\nI'm currently working on a project with around 15GBs of assets I'm committing on a git repo the .godot/imported directory to prevent the slow reimport process on every machine.\nHowever, the reimport triggers anyways for all assets.\n\nReimporting is also very problematic as there seems to be a memory leak during import process, making the machines run out of memory and making us unable to re-run the import process on every machine.\n\nCopying over filesystem_cache10 mitigates the issues if the files modification date is lower than what reported in filesystem_cache10 as godot does not test the assets for reimport\n\nCommitting filesystem_cache10 is obviously not a solution as it gets constantly updated by the different machines.\n\nThe problem dosen't seem related to the cache itself as when it's missing it just triggers a re-analysis of the files, it should be instead located in this function as it seems to detect changes even when there aren't. However I couldn't find any obvious mistake\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4d1f26e1fd1fa46f2223fe0b6ac300744bf79b88/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L573\n\nI also don't have a compilation environment currently setup to test changes\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create new project\n- Add some assets and wait for import\n- Close the project\n- Delete .godot/engine/filesystem_cache10\n- Open the project\n\nAll the assets will reimport\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[platformer.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21145135/platformer.zip)\n\nEven in this official demo project you can reproduce the problem, although very quick given the small number of assets.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108441/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}